# Homescool narrative language

When authoring or revising **Homescool** `.eoschool` JSON (level **6**, ≈ **8 years**), follow:

**[`docs/specs/009-homescool-narrative-language.md`](../../docs/specs/009-homescool-narrative-language.md)**

Also keep [`METHOD_V1.md`](../../frontend/public/skills/eoschool/METHOD_V1.md) pedagogy (intro/deepen/review, quiz counts, dual storage) and [`homescool-class-method-v2.mdc`](homescool-class-method-v2.mdc) for the **Letter grid v2** printed sheet.

## Letter grid v2 (printed sheet — canonical for new rewrites)

Authority: **class-method-v2** ask-first rhythm on `lesson.slotSequence`:

**pregunta → espacio en blanco → respuesta corta → `Cópiala aquí:` + 2 líneas**

- Opening + Repaso (3 lines); typically **5** points per class.  
- **Do not** require `Práctica: Ahora te toca a ti.` or `Error común:` as separate sheet blocks — fold practice/mistakes into the same beat.  
- MCQ: one-line prompts; **do not** require the prefix «Elige la respuesta correcta.».  
- Soft limit **≤ 66** characters per lesson line for column width.

## Non-negotiables (all surfaces)

- Voice ≈ 8 years; short complete sentences; gloss school terms on first use.  
- **Never** forbidden boilerplate in spec 009 (including «Antes de terminar, un aviso», «Esta clase te ayuda a aprender…», `Respuesta:` on MCQ choices).  
- Adapt quizzes by **replacing** questions, not only prefixes.  
- After cell edits for publish: `node scripts/build-homescool-curriculum.mjs` only when the user asks.
